@startuml
title 5G PDU Session Establishment

participant UE
participant gNB
participant AMF
participant SMF
participant UPF

UE -> gNB: PDU Session Establishment Request (NAS)
gNB -> AMF: Initial UE Message

AMF -> SMF: Create SM Context (Nsmf_SM)
SMF -> UPF: PFCP Session Establishment
UPF -> SMF: PFCP Session Response

AMF -> gNB: PDU Session Accept (NGAP)
gNB -> UE: RRC Reconfiguration (DRB Setup)

@enduml
